  "version": "0.18.0-alpha.2",
  "notes": "## 0.18.0-alpha.2 - 2026-07-03\n\n### Features\n\n- Add a startup mode setting with Normal, Silent, and Lightweight options, plus an option to restore the most recent clipboard history item when the app starts (#1275)\n- Let you choose a folder where received files are saved directly instead of keeping them only in managed storage (#1271)\n- Move content tags on history cards to their own row so item details are easier to scan (#1279)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Update prompts now show release notes, respect your selected update channel, and check for a newer release again before installing (#1280)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.18.0-alpha.2 - 2026-07-03\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增启动方式设置，可选择正常、静默或轻量模式，并可在应用启动后恢复最近一条剪贴板历史记录 (#1275)\n- 支持选择接收文件的保存文件夹，让收到的文件直接保存到指定位置，而不是只保存在应用托管目录中 (#1271)\n- 历史记录卡片会将内容标签移到单独一行，便于浏览条目信息 (#1279)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 更新提示现在会显示更新日志、遵循你选择的更新渠道，并在安装前再次检查是否已有更新版本 (#1280)",
